				<description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;the-inspiration&#34;&gt;The Inspiration&lt;a class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; href=&#34;#the-inspiration&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;After experiencing one too many &amp;ldquo;You&amp;rsquo;re away from home&amp;rdquo; and other related errors from streaming services, I finally decided to hop into the world of self-hosting a Jellyfin server.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;how-it-was-built&#34;&gt;How it was Built&lt;a class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; href=&#34;#how-it-was-built&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;aside class=&#34;callout callout--note&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;span class=&#34;callout__icon&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;i&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;span class=&#34;callout__text&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;callout__label&#34;&gt;Note&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;callout__body&#34;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Watch an example video made for a Field Hockey Goalie in 2022. Submitted clips can be zoomed in, cropped, slowed down and more.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;iframe title=&#34;McKenna Laman - 2022 GK - Fall 2019 HS Compilation (mckennajaye@gmail.com)&#34; width=&#34;500&#34; height=&#34;281&#34; src=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/embed/p5EdIyL_1Mw?feature=oembed&#34; frameborder=&#34;0&#34; allow=&#34;accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share&#34; referrerpolicy=&#34;strict-origin-when-cross-origin&#34; allowfullscreen=&#34;&#34;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/aside&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;troubleshooting-and-hardships&#34;&gt;Troubleshooting and hardships&lt;a class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; href=&#34;#troubleshooting-and-hardships&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;Storage is expensive!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;</description>
